{"text": "\u2014 Susan Z. Cohen\n\u2014\u2014 ae\n\nSENIOR SERVICES | Wolfson Health & Aging Center re\n\nApril 14, 2020\n\nRon DeSantis, Governor, State of Florida\nPlaza Level 05, The Capitol\n400 S. Monroe Street\nTallahassee, FL 32399-0001\n\nEmail: GovernorRon.Desantis@eog.myflorida.com\n\nMary Mayhew, Secretary\nAgency for Health Care Administration\n2727 Mahan Drive, Mail Stop 1\nTallahassee, FL 32308\nEmail: mary.mayhew( \\ca.myflorida.com\n\nScott A. Rivkees, MD, State Surgeon General\nSecretary, Florida Department of Health\n4052 Bald Cypress Way, Bin #400\nTallahassee, FL 32399\nEmail: floridasurgeongeneral@flhealth.gov\n\nDear Governor DeSantis, Secretary Mayhew and Surgeon General Rivkees,\n\nThank you for implementing \u201cstrike teams\u201d using the Florida National Guard to implement\ntesting for COVID-19. What is now required is not assessments; it is testing \u2014 the immediate\ntesting of all residents and staff residing in nursing homes and ALFs. Not testing this most at-risk\npopulation, all of whom live in close quarters, is simply unconscionable.\n\nIt is well understood that COVID-19 is particularly deadly for older people ~ more so for seniors\nwho are already medically compromised. It is no accident that when COVID-19 enters a nursing\nfacility, the mortality rate can easily approach 50 percent. It is also well established that as many\nas 25 percent of individuals who are positive for the virus are asymptomatic, an especially\ntroubling statistic.\n\n\u2018We demand testing immediately, starting with those nursing homes and ALFs throughout Florida\nthat have already been identified as having COVID-19 in their facilities and quickly expanding\nto everyone. This is an urgent need requiring an immediate response; anything short of an\nimmediate testing program places residents and staff in \u201cimmediate jeopardy.\u201d Telling facilities\nthat testing will begin in another week is unacceptable. The need is immediate and response must\nbe in proportion to the identified threat.\n\n11401 Old St Augustine Rood Jacksonville, Flarida 32258-1402 (90) 260-188 Fax: (904) 2609733 worvergarden.org\n\nfod yar tn Sy\u00bb Snes 1,90 dg Ec Dt\u00bb AB ge a itn dt\nes a a on ofr oe ata et sa",
